and the dependencies whose DEPS revision changed (V8, ICU, Dawn, Skia, ANGLE),
as served by Gitiles, with scripts/chromium-delta --branch-fixes: left out are files not in the
release tarball, iOS/Android/ChromeOS/Mac/Windows-only files, tests and docs,
translations, PGO/orderfile pointers, submodule pointer updates.
chrome/VERSION, DEPS and the stamp files stay at 158.0.8127.23.

